WEBVTT

01:31.380 --> 01:35.170
<b>#8 Farewell</b>

01:50.710 --> 01:53.130
Wh-what just happened...?

01:54.250 --> 01:57.080
Never mind... I need to get out of here!

02:13.630 --> 02:14.960
Remember, Zenia...

02:14.960 --> 02:19.580
unlike us demons, humans shall never
awaken from death's sweet slumber.

02:19.580 --> 02:22.130
You mustn't kill them so hastily.

02:22.130 --> 02:23.250
Understand?

02:24.830 --> 02:27.380
C'mon, hang in there! Can you hear me?!

02:29.790 --> 02:33.500
Seven Spy Tools #8: First-aid Kit!

02:37.170 --> 02:40.540
Don't worry... I'll get you to safety!

02:41.130 --> 02:42.750
Everyone stand back!

02:43.670 --> 02:45.670
Go! Keep moving!

02:46.540 --> 02:48.460
I can't just leave like this...

02:48.460 --> 02:50.420
I'd be a disgrace to the demon race!

02:50.420 --> 02:53.170
There's got to be something... ANYTHING!

02:53.170 --> 02:55.000
What can I bring back...?!

02:55.580 --> 02:56.880
I know!

03:02.000 --> 03:04.250
Max! We've got big trouble!

03:04.250 --> 03:07.960
...to officials, there was a mysterious
explosion at the Royal Bureau of Magic

03:04.250 --> 03:07.170
<b>Breaking News</b>

03:04.250 --> 03:07.170
<b>Mysterious Explosion</b>

03:04.250 --> 03:07.170
<b>at the Bureau of Magic</b>

03:07.960 --> 03:08.670
at approximately four o'clock this afternoon.

03:08.670 --> 03:10.960
The hell? Wait, is this live?
at approximately four o'clock this afternoon.<b></b>

03:11.580 --> 03:13.670
We're being told that most personnel
have been accounted for,

03:13.670 --> 03:15.500
Gotta be a terrorist attack, right?
We're being told that most personnel<b>
</b>have been accounted for,<b></b>

03:15.500 --> 03:18.420
I-isn't that the building where Fred works?
but the exact number of casualties<b>
</b>has yet to be determined.<b></b>

03:18.880 --> 03:20.750
Knowin' him, he's fine.

03:20.750 --> 03:23.580
Blast like that ain't nearly enough to kill him.

03:23.580 --> 03:25.500
I-if you say so...

03:25.500 --> 03:30.040
To tell you the truth, I might've asked Zenia
to do some digging on the Magic Bureau...

03:30.040 --> 03:31.040
Huh?

03:31.040 --> 03:34.540
You... don't think she's the one
who did this, do you?

03:35.170 --> 03:36.920
Why would she do that...?

03:36.920 --> 03:40.500
I mean, I never told her to actually
GO to the Magic Bureau.

03:40.500 --> 03:43.250
And I would never dream of
telling her to bomb it.

03:43.250 --> 03:45.670
Yeah, that's what I figured.

03:56.580 --> 03:58.750
Let's, uh, watch a variety show.

03:59.420 --> 04:00.830
Good idea.

04:05.670 --> 04:07.830
Y-Your Grace!

04:10.080 --> 04:13.920
I-I have returned... from my visit... to the...

04:19.580 --> 04:23.290
S-something... smells...

04:25.460 --> 04:27.210
Wh-what?

04:27.790 --> 04:30.210
Oh, are you feeling better?

04:31.540 --> 04:34.210
Good to see you up and at 'em!

04:34.540 --> 04:38.630
Huh? U-um, who are you...?

04:39.380 --> 04:41.330
Ow-ow-ow...

04:42.250 --> 04:44.790
Are you alright? Don't overdo it...

04:45.130 --> 04:46.960
You were injured pretty badly...

04:46.960 --> 04:49.130
I found you passed out outside.

04:51.500 --> 04:53.580
That's right. The explosion...

04:54.460 --> 04:56.540
I must've lost consciousness after that.

04:56.540 --> 04:59.540
But how did I end up here
instead of the hospital...?

04:59.540 --> 05:02.130
Please, take it easy and get some rest.

05:02.130 --> 05:04.380
I'll make you something to eat, okay?

05:04.380 --> 05:06.000
This apartment...

05:06.880 --> 05:09.210
Where have I seen it before...?

05:09.960 --> 05:11.790
Thank you.

05:11.790 --> 05:13.790
Are you the one who
dressed my wound?

05:13.790 --> 05:14.960
Yes.

05:14.960 --> 05:16.710
And you live here alone?

05:17.130 --> 05:20.710
No. I live with my husband,
but he's not home at the moment.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.170
Is that some sort of work uniform...?

05:24.170 --> 05:27.290
It seems... unreasonably small...

05:27.290 --> 05:29.630
Anything in particular you want to eat?

05:30.040 --> 05:32.580
No... and unfortunately,

05:32.580 --> 05:35.460
I should be getting back to work,
so... please excuse me.

05:35.460 --> 05:37.880
Huh? Oh, but you can't!

05:37.880 --> 05:39.500
You really ought to lie down.

05:39.500 --> 05:40.920
That's not an option.

05:40.920 --> 05:42.750
Y'see, I...

05:43.880 --> 05:47.130
Just relax for a little while longer.

05:48.000 --> 05:49.080
Got it?

05:50.330 --> 05:52.250
B-but I...

05:52.250 --> 05:54.790
Such a promising youth...

05:55.080 --> 05:57.790
With such strong magic powers...

05:59.130 --> 06:02.290
What a pity it would be
to let you stay human...

06:02.830 --> 06:05.170
Forget about being Fred's underling.

06:05.170 --> 06:07.670
Come work for me instead.

06:06.000 --> 06:07.670
<b>Employment Contract</b>

06:07.830 --> 06:10.790
You shall live seven lifetimes just like us.

06:10.790 --> 06:12.710
Plus biannual bonuses,

06:12.710 --> 06:14.580
a comprehensive insurance package,

06:14.580 --> 06:16.670
and a substantial housing allowance.

06:17.420 --> 06:18.750
What's your name?

06:18.750 --> 06:20.880
It's, uh, Lim...

06:21.290 --> 06:22.500
Very well.

06:22.790 --> 06:25.580
Come along, Lim. Take my hand...

06:28.880 --> 06:32.920
...and walk the path of eternal life by my side-

06:32.920 --> 06:34.130
Cut it out!

06:34.130 --> 06:35.420
Owie!

06:35.420 --> 06:38.040
What's the big idea, Max?!
That's domestic violence, y'know!

06:38.040 --> 06:40.710
This ain't the time for
yer unethical contract bullshit.

06:40.710 --> 06:43.290
I never should've let you handle this...

06:43.290 --> 06:46.330
Make... pact...

06:47.630 --> 06:51.790
Before anything else...
I'd like to apologize for this whole mess.

06:52.460 --> 06:55.670
So you're telling me that
Miss Long Hair over here

06:55.670 --> 06:59.460
ordered Glasses Girl to infiltrate
the Bureau of Magic?

07:00.080 --> 07:01.670
That's exactly right!

07:01.670 --> 07:04.750
Except the decision to infiltrate
the Bureau was my own!

07:04.750 --> 07:07.250
The blame rests solely on MY shoulders!

07:07.750 --> 07:11.880
No, no... It was MY vague instructions
that caused the confusion.

07:11.880 --> 07:13.630
She's not at fault...

07:13.630 --> 07:16.880
And either way, Max may be the one
who owns this apartment,

07:16.880 --> 07:19.630
but he had absolutely NOTHING to do with this.

07:19.630 --> 07:21.960
So please, PLEASE don't be mad at him...

07:24.500 --> 07:27.880
The two of you are demons, aren't you?

07:28.380 --> 07:30.380
Yes, we are...

07:31.630 --> 07:34.710
Max, would you care to explain yourself?

07:34.710 --> 07:37.210
P-please, allow ME to explain!

07:37.710 --> 07:42.420
After the death of our beloved Demon Lord,
us lowly underlings had nowhere to go...

07:42.420 --> 07:45.920
We were forced to live a life
of poverty and starvation...

07:45.920 --> 07:47.750
Going hungry every night,

07:47.750 --> 07:50.330
exposed to the harsh elements
and nearly freezing to death...

07:50.330 --> 07:52.380
Literally NONE of that happened...

07:52.380 --> 07:55.670
It was well-deserved karma for
all the trouble we'd caused, yes...

07:55.670 --> 07:57.830
but you can imagine how hopeless we felt...

07:58.330 --> 08:01.170
BUT THEN! Max, the World's Greatest Hero,

08:01.170 --> 08:06.330
took pity on us poor, master-less wretches
and saved us from the streets!

08:06.330 --> 08:11.290
After what us demons did,
he had every right to leave us to die!

08:11.290 --> 08:15.670
Our hearts were DEEPLY moved
by Max's generosity!

08:15.670 --> 08:18.750
And from that point on, we vowed to
dedicate our lives to mankind,

08:18.750 --> 08:21.000
and to society at large!

08:21.000 --> 08:22.130
Right, Zenia?!

08:22.130 --> 08:23.960
Y-yeah, sure!

08:23.960 --> 08:26.750
All I wanted was to investigate
the Bureau of Magic

08:26.750 --> 08:29.580
so that we could learn more about
humans and their professions!

08:29.580 --> 08:32.330
But everything went downhill
'cause of a tiny miscommunication!

08:32.330 --> 08:35.170
I'm utterly ashamed of myself!

08:35.170 --> 08:37.710
I see... I understand the situation now.

08:37.710 --> 08:39.130
You bought that crap?!

08:39.500 --> 08:42.630
This woman's WAY too trusting...

08:42.630 --> 08:44.920
So then the explosion at the Magic Bureau...

08:44.920 --> 08:47.830
that wasn't your doing, was it?

08:47.830 --> 08:49.830
N-no, of course not!

08:49.830 --> 08:53.540
I-I'd never allow her to handle something
as dangerous as a bomb!

08:53.540 --> 08:56.250
To be honest, I thought for sure

08:56.250 --> 08:59.000
your fire magic had ignited
some gas or something...

08:59.290 --> 09:03.920
My flames would never catch
any sort of gas or oil on fire.

09:03.920 --> 09:07.460
I'm in control of when they burn
and when they stop.

09:07.460 --> 09:08.920
Wow...!

09:08.920 --> 09:11.170
I gotta get my hands on this woman...

09:11.170 --> 09:15.000
But if that's the case,
then who on earth could have...?

09:16.630 --> 09:18.880
That's right, I totally forgot!

09:18.880 --> 09:20.830
I have your phone, Miss Lim!

09:20.830 --> 09:22.830
Huh? Oh...

09:22.830 --> 09:26.290
You received quite a few calls
while you were asleep...

09:26.290 --> 09:28.210
<b>Chief Secretary Fred</b>

09:26.290 --> 09:28.210
<b>Mobile</b>

09:26.290 --> 09:28.210
<b>Incoming</b>

09:28.460 --> 09:29.580
Do you mind?

09:29.580 --> 09:30.710
Go ahead.

09:31.250 --> 09:32.460
Hello?

09:32.460 --> 09:34.500
Lim, where are you right now?

09:36.210 --> 09:37.960
My apologies, Chief Secretary.

09:37.960 --> 09:41.210
I was injured in the blast
and lost consciousness.

09:41.210 --> 09:44.630
So, um... I'm being treated as we speak.

09:44.630 --> 09:47.710
You're at the hospital?
Doesn't sound like it.

09:47.710 --> 09:49.540
Where are you?

09:49.920 --> 09:51.380
Well, I...

09:51.750 --> 09:53.960
You can tell him the truth.

09:55.330 --> 09:57.920
I'm at Max the Hero's apartment.

09:58.540 --> 09:59.830
Pass me to him.

10:03.170 --> 10:04.710
Fred.

10:04.710 --> 10:06.670
Now then, Max...

10:06.670 --> 10:09.290
Would you mind giving me an explanation'?

10:09.290 --> 10:12.630
Colluding with demons and
attacking government buildings?

10:12.630 --> 10:15.750
My, how the Hero has fallen. Hm?

10:16.080 --> 10:18.710
Fine, I admit it. I hang out with demons.

10:18.710 --> 10:22.040
But me and them had nothin' to do
with that explosion.

10:22.040 --> 10:24.290
Oh yeah? A likely story...

10:24.290 --> 10:27.790
What's to stop me from telling everyone
you were responsible?

10:27.790 --> 10:30.330
In fact, that'd be much more convenient.

10:30.330 --> 10:32.630
Letting you take the fall.

10:34.080 --> 10:36.330
Look, I can explain everything!

10:36.330 --> 10:37.540
Can we meet up?

10:37.540 --> 10:38.880
Fine by me.

10:38.880 --> 10:41.500
Just wait there. I'll be by shortly.

10:41.500 --> 10:43.630
And no hiding the demons this time.

10:43.630 --> 10:46.130
Yeah, yeah. But I've got a question...

10:46.130 --> 10:48.170
Last time you came to my place,

10:48.170 --> 10:50.460
you sensed the demons
almost immediately, right?

10:50.790 --> 10:54.080
So why'dja take off so quickly without-

10:54.080 --> 10:55.460
Who's there?

10:56.290 --> 10:58.420
Fred? Hello?

10:56.290 --> 10:58.710
<b>Lim</b>

10:56.290 --> 10:58.710
<b>Mobile</b>

10:56.290 --> 10:58.710
<b>Ongoing Call</b>

10:58.880 --> 11:00.290
Can ya hear me?

11:03.040 --> 11:06.670
Yeah, on second thought,
your apartment's a little too cramped...

11:08.210 --> 11:10.380
I, uh, know a good restaurant.

11:10.380 --> 11:12.880
I'll make the reservations,
so let's meet there.

11:12.880 --> 11:14.080
Sure.

11:14.380 --> 11:16.250
You'd better show up.

11:16.580 --> 11:18.130
I will.

11:21.630 --> 11:23.210
I should've known.

11:23.210 --> 11:26.290
You're not one for this type of
petty behavior...

11:28.580 --> 11:30.290
<b>Incoming Call</b>

11:34.290 --> 11:36.580
You can hear me, can't you?

11:36.580 --> 11:39.960
Answer the damn phone!

11:39.960 --> 11:42.080
This area is directly below
the blast's epicenter!

11:42.080 --> 11:43.630
Be careful, the ceiling might collapse!

11:43.630 --> 11:44.710
Roger!

11:46.380 --> 11:48.210
We've got a survivor over here!

11:48.210 --> 11:49.580
Coward... coward... coward... coward...

11:49.580 --> 11:51.330
Chief Secretary Fred!
Coward... coward... coward... coward...<b></b>

11:51.330 --> 11:53.500
He must've gotten caught in the blast!
Coward... coward... coward... coward...<b></b>

11:53.500 --> 11:55.710
Oh God... We need to get him out of here now!
Coward... coward... coward... coward...<b></b>

11:56.790 --> 12:00.580
But Captain, how could something like this
happen at the Magic Bureau?!

12:00.580 --> 12:01.880
I don't know.

12:01.880 --> 12:05.710
But if it really was a terrorist attack
carried out by the Gamma Republic, then...

12:06.420 --> 12:08.540
things are going to get ugly.

12:10.040 --> 12:12.960
<b>Beskar Kingdom: Cabinet Office Building</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:15.880
<b>Meeting of the Nine Cabinet Ministers</b>

12:17.380 --> 12:20.580
What a dreadful mishap.
You were at the Magic Bureau, yes?

12:17.380 --> 12:20.580
<b>Fourth Minister: Reinhardt</b>

12:20.580 --> 12:24.290
I was. Barely made it out in time.
Huge headache.

12:20.580 --> 12:24.290
<b>Third Minister: Grimms</b>

12:24.290 --> 12:26.170
We're relieved that you're safe.

12:24.290 --> 12:29.880
<b>Sixth Minister: Hayward</b>

12:26.170 --> 12:29.880
However, we now have a very serious
problem on our hands.

12:29.880 --> 12:36.170
<b>First Minister: Franca</b>

12:30.420 --> 12:33.080
I had a feeling this day
would come eventually.

12:33.080 --> 12:36.170
Ever since you lot expelled
Leo from the Kingdom.

12:36.460 --> 12:37.960
Are you happy now?

12:37.960 --> 12:40.540
You've got your excuse to go to war.

12:41.170 --> 12:44.250
This isn't the underhanded scheme
you're making it out to be.

12:41.170 --> 12:49.500
<b>Eighth Minister: Menehild</b>

12:44.250 --> 12:47.080
It's clear terrorist behavior
on behalf of the Gamma Republic.

12:47.080 --> 12:49.500
They're endangering the Kingdom
and its people!

12:49.500 --> 12:50.920
I can't help but wonder...

12:49.500 --> 12:54.000
<b>Fifth Minister: Zeeman</b>

12:50.920 --> 12:54.000
if there's some way we could reach
an amicable agreement...

12:54.000 --> 12:56.540
What are you suggesting we do?

12:54.000 --> 12:59.790
<b>Second Minister: Trigorin</b>

12:56.540 --> 12:59.790
Bow our heads and ask them to stop politely?

13:00.040 --> 13:03.540
We are prepared to mobilize our troops
at a moment's notice.

13:03.540 --> 13:05.670
However, the purpose of
all military endeavors thus far

13:05.670 --> 13:08.040
has been to "exercise our territorial claims."

13:08.040 --> 13:11.250
Because of that, we've managed
to avoid a full-blown war,

13:08.040 --> 13:16.210
<b>Ninth Minister: George</b>

13:11.250 --> 13:14.500
as well as a loss of human life
on both sides.

13:14.500 --> 13:16.210
But this time is different.

13:16.580 --> 13:19.960
If the Royal Army were to invade
using its full force...

13:19.960 --> 13:22.040
they will respond in kind.

13:22.330 --> 13:26.170
Though the chances of defeat are slim,
there would be tremendous casualties.

13:26.170 --> 13:28.420
And I refuse to let my men die.

13:28.420 --> 13:31.460
The chances of defeat are slim?
That's rich comin' from you.

13:31.460 --> 13:34.420
Ya been out there poking 'em with a stick
'cause ya can't win.

13:34.420 --> 13:36.580
Quit actin' tough, Mr. Soldier Wannabe.

13:36.580 --> 13:38.420
That was totally unnecessary, Sezek!

13:38.420 --> 13:40.830
Yeah, yeah... My bad.

13:38.420 --> 13:40.830
<b>Seventh Minister: Sezek</b>

13:41.380 --> 13:45.080
So what we need is enough power
to be able to take on Leo.

13:45.380 --> 13:48.210
The only people who can challenge
one of the Hero's companions are,

13:48.210 --> 13:50.630
well, the Hero's other companions...

13:50.960 --> 13:54.790
Grimms... you and Fred are
particularly close, yes?

13:54.790 --> 13:56.540
Can you convince him to do it?

13:56.540 --> 13:58.790
Seeing as the rest of them are useless.

13:58.790 --> 14:00.460
Oh jeez...

14:00.460 --> 14:02.710
Guess I got the short end of the stick...

14:08.380 --> 14:09.630
Wow...

14:09.630 --> 14:12.880
This place seems really fancy, don'tcha think?

14:12.880 --> 14:15.920
Well, it's one of the Chief Secretary's
favorite restaurants.

14:16.170 --> 14:18.210
Shave your frickin' beard, ya slob!

14:18.210 --> 14:20.710
They're not gonna let you in looking like that!

14:26.830 --> 14:29.630
Hoo-boy, that's quite a spread.

14:29.630 --> 14:31.670
You always eat like a king?

14:31.670 --> 14:32.750
Weirdo...

14:32.750 --> 14:34.670
I don't make a habit of it.

14:35.040 --> 14:38.250
But it's been a long time since you and I
last had a meal together.

14:38.250 --> 14:40.250
Please feel free to help yourself.

14:40.250 --> 14:42.210
Thank you so much!

14:42.210 --> 14:44.920
Whoa, this is amazing! Look, Max!

14:44.920 --> 14:48.500
This sashimi is see-through,
and it practically sparkles!

14:48.670 --> 14:50.630
I can't wait to taste it!

14:50.790 --> 14:53.040
It's tough- er, delicious!

14:53.040 --> 14:55.250
You must be pretty powerful to pull that off.

14:56.290 --> 14:59.170
You're nearly indistinguishable
from a real human.

14:59.170 --> 15:02.170
I'm surprised a dangerous demon
like you managed to survive...

15:04.330 --> 15:05.920
"Zenia," was it?

15:05.920 --> 15:08.630
The woman with the glasses.
She works for you?

15:08.630 --> 15:09.540
Yes...

15:09.540 --> 15:13.040
I'm sorry, Fred.
For all the trouble we caused.

15:13.420 --> 15:15.250
My sincerest apologies...

15:15.710 --> 15:19.170
Well, at least you seem to be
enjoying yourself.

15:22.210 --> 15:26.040
I guess you just can't find a nice
HUMAN woman to settle down with...

15:26.040 --> 15:27.420
almighty Hero or not.

15:27.420 --> 15:28.790
Shuddup!

15:29.920 --> 15:31.750
Can't say I'm not jealous.

15:31.750 --> 15:35.080
I mean, who wouldn't want to live with
two drop-dead gorgeous women?

15:35.080 --> 15:37.080
Aww, you're making me blush!

15:37.080 --> 15:40.130
Yeah, if only he knew
what you REALLY look like...

15:42.540 --> 15:45.790
I wanna explain everything.
Y'know, clear the air.

15:45.790 --> 15:48.380
The explosion at the Magic Bureau wasn't-

15:48.380 --> 15:51.790
I'm well aware that you played
no part in the explosion.

15:52.040 --> 15:55.000
After Zenia infiltrated the Bureau
through the roof,

15:55.000 --> 15:57.540
she left evidence of her presence
in several places.

15:57.540 --> 15:59.500
If she had planted the bomb herself,

15:59.500 --> 16:02.130
she wouldn't have just sat around
and waited inside the building.

16:02.130 --> 16:03.500
No matter how stupid she is.

16:03.500 --> 16:05.080
O-oh!

16:05.250 --> 16:08.460
Thank God, you understand!
You're the man, Fred!

16:08.460 --> 16:11.880
Thanks a million!
Everyone needs a friend like you!

16:11.880 --> 16:13.380
Knock it off.

16:13.380 --> 16:15.710
Well, I guess we got it all sorted out!

16:15.710 --> 16:17.880
Thanks for the grub!
Catch ya later.

16:18.130 --> 16:19.380
Hold it.

16:19.750 --> 16:22.880
What I'm saying is,
I'll let this little incident slide...

16:22.880 --> 16:25.500
but in exchange,
you have to do something for me.

16:25.500 --> 16:27.290
Oh, uh...

16:27.290 --> 16:30.500
then how's about I letcha borrow HER
for the night, no questions asked?

16:30.500 --> 16:31.500
EXCUSE ME?!

16:31.500 --> 16:33.210
Y-you can't be serious!

16:33.210 --> 16:35.210
What the hell is wrong with you, Max?!

16:35.210 --> 16:36.330
Sexist creep!

16:36.330 --> 16:40.040
Y'know, for a Hero, that was
a sinister thing to suggest...

16:40.040 --> 16:43.210
Oh, come on.
Zenia's YOUR underling, isn't she?

16:43.210 --> 16:47.710
And taking responsibility for a subordinate's
incompetency is a supervisor's job, right?

16:48.500 --> 16:50.290
F-fine.

16:50.290 --> 16:54.040
If I must, then... you may use me
until you're satisfied...

16:54.040 --> 16:55.710
No, thanks! Put your damn clothes on!

16:55.710 --> 16:58.420
We need to have a serious discussion.
Now sit down.

16:58.420 --> 16:59.460
Gotcha.

16:59.460 --> 17:01.330
So, not even a peek...?

17:02.960 --> 17:06.420
There's about to be a full-scale war
against the Gamma Republic.

17:06.420 --> 17:10.380
Because they went and pulled some stupid crap
like blowing up a government building.

17:11.000 --> 17:14.080
Are you positive they're the ones behind it?

17:14.080 --> 17:16.670
Of course. Who else would it be?

17:16.670 --> 17:18.170
Who knows?

17:18.880 --> 17:21.750
I just think it coulda been
a lot bigger and more exciting...

17:23.130 --> 17:25.830
What are you implying, Max?

17:25.830 --> 17:27.170
Nothing.

17:30.670 --> 17:32.500
Say, Max...

17:32.710 --> 17:34.540
I'm starting to get the feeling

17:34.540 --> 17:37.500
that you think I WANT to go to war
with the Gamma Republic.

17:37.500 --> 17:38.920
Which is ridiculous.

17:38.920 --> 17:40.790
It's the complete opposite.

17:40.790 --> 17:44.290
Though that's not to say the Kingdom
wouldn't appreciate your cooperation.

17:44.420 --> 17:46.960
But if you continue to refuse to help us,

17:46.960 --> 17:51.380
then I might have to implicate you and
your demon buddies in the terrorist attack.

17:51.380 --> 17:55.830
It'd allow us to avoid all-out war with
the Republic, at least for the time being.

17:56.500 --> 17:59.420
As far as I'm concerned,
I don't care what happens either way.

18:00.630 --> 18:04.330
So this is your final chance
to rethink your decision.

18:04.880 --> 18:08.330
Return as the Hero and
fight on behalf of the Kingdom?

18:08.330 --> 18:10.540
Or be an accomplice to demons,

18:10.540 --> 18:13.750
be branded a criminal,
and kiss your life goodbye?

18:17.920 --> 18:22.420
Ah jeez, talk about a pain in the ass!

18:22.920 --> 18:24.880
Time to go house shopping!

18:24.880 --> 18:27.790
Guess I gotta move to the
Gamma Republic with this little lady!

18:27.790 --> 18:29.500
Wait... What?

18:29.790 --> 18:31.130
Come again?

18:34.330 --> 18:36.330
Man, that water sure was nice!

18:36.330 --> 18:40.170
The Gamma Republic is a very lovely place.
Don'tcha agree?

18:41.000 --> 18:43.830
Let's hightail it outta this
pathetic excuse for a country!

18:43.830 --> 18:47.420
Livin' out my golden years as a prune
in those hot springs doesn't sound half bad!

18:47.420 --> 18:49.460
Plus, they got plenty of
magic ore mines over there!

18:49.460 --> 18:52.710
For all we know, I could become
a frickin' billionaire!

18:53.210 --> 18:55.380
I can't turn a blind eye, Max.

18:55.380 --> 18:58.040
I have to take this as proof of intent
to aid a terrorist organization.

18:58.460 --> 19:00.710
You're going to make an enemy
out of the Kingdom.

19:00.710 --> 19:02.210
That's the point!

19:02.210 --> 19:06.040
Don't wanna piss off the big bad Hero
who slayed the Demon Lord, do ya?

19:06.040 --> 19:09.500
So maybe you oughtta try askin' me
a little more nicely, hm?

19:09.500 --> 19:11.460
Egotistical bastard...!

19:11.460 --> 19:14.080
You haven't been a hero in a LONG time...

19:14.080 --> 19:17.210
You're just a lazy deadbeat
who happens to be annoyingly strong!

19:17.210 --> 19:18.380
Oh, NOW ya done it!

19:18.380 --> 19:20.290
I'm sick of yer shit!
I'll do it right fucking now!

19:20.290 --> 19:22.710
Don't you DARE think I won't move
to the Gamma Republic!

19:22.710 --> 19:26.290
Even the Gamma Republic wouldn't want
a useless piece of garbage like you!

19:26.290 --> 19:28.330
Wake up, you stupid asshole!

19:28.330 --> 19:30.880
Uh, take it easy, you guys...

19:30.880 --> 19:32.000
Shut yer mouth!

19:32.000 --> 19:33.540
YOU'RE the stupid assholes here!

19:33.540 --> 19:35.330
Waging yer stupid little wars!

19:35.330 --> 19:37.830
Do whatever ya want, but leave me out of it!

19:37.830 --> 19:40.710
I want to put an END to this war!

19:40.710 --> 19:42.170
Why can't you get that through
your thick skull?!

19:42.170 --> 19:45.420
If we're lucky, maybe you morons
will manage to kill each other!

19:45.420 --> 19:49.040
If both you AND Leo die,
I'll finally get some peace and quiet!

19:49.040 --> 19:50.250
SON OF A BITCH!

19:53.960 --> 19:55.330
That's enough!

20:00.290 --> 20:01.670
Let go of me!

20:02.630 --> 20:05.920
Max... Who IS this demon?

20:06.250 --> 20:09.250
Does it matter? We're done here.

20:11.790 --> 20:14.250
You haven't heard the last of us, Max.

20:14.250 --> 20:16.750
Your strength is a liability.

20:16.750 --> 20:19.210
If we can't rein you in...

20:19.630 --> 20:22.130
Oh, that reminds me.
Forgot to bring my wallet today,

20:22.130 --> 20:24.330
so I'll letcha handle the bill.

20:24.330 --> 20:26.460
That's what taxpayer money's for, right?

20:27.040 --> 20:29.460
I should've poisoned you
when I had the chance...

20:35.830 --> 20:37.670
Home sweet home...

20:42.250 --> 20:45.000
You shouldn't leave your clothes
on the floor, Max.

20:46.040 --> 20:47.710
Especially not your nice suit jacket...

20:47.710 --> 20:48.710
Welcome home.
Especially not your nice suit jacket...<b></b>

20:54.710 --> 20:56.830
Max?! What's the matter?!

20:57.170 --> 20:59.080
D-don't tell me...!

21:02.670 --> 21:06.790
Goddammit, he got me!

21:06.790 --> 21:08.420
You had me worried.

21:08.420 --> 21:11.210
For a second there,
I thought he really DID poison you.

21:11.210 --> 21:13.880
Laxatives, poison... Same difference!

21:13.880 --> 21:15.380
That jerk...!

21:16.880 --> 21:20.750
It must've been mixed into your sake
from the very beginning.

21:20.750 --> 21:25.000
What exactly was he going to do if I had
decided to comply with his demands?!

21:25.500 --> 21:28.250
I have a sneaking suspicion
he knew you'd never go along with it.

21:28.250 --> 21:31.540
It was probably payback for
the whole mess with Zenia.

21:43.380 --> 21:45.830
<b>The Gamma Times</b>

21:43.380 --> 21:45.830
<b>Alleged Terrorist Attack</b>

21:43.380 --> 21:45.830
<b>by the Gamma Republic</b>

21:43.380 --> 21:45.830
<b>Magic Bureau</b>

21:43.380 --> 21:45.830
<b>Bombing Incident</b>

21:46.000 --> 21:47.380
No freakin' way!

21:47.380 --> 21:49.330
THIS is how they're going to justify a war?!

21:49.330 --> 21:52.790
They're a bunch of evil bastards!
Rotten, every last one of 'em!

21:53.210 --> 21:56.830
I swear, Boss!
We'd never do somethin' like this!

21:56.830 --> 21:58.710
I know.

21:58.710 --> 22:00.710
It seems the time is upon us...

22:03.500 --> 22:06.380
If you think I'm going to
let this go unpunished,

22:06.380 --> 22:08.210
then you're no motherland of mine!

22:08.420 --> 22:10.130
So bring it on!
